:: EyesAcrossDistance
<<set $textChunks to [
  "Three or four days passed. The ignorant bride believed the seth was teasing her, that surely he would return any minute.",
  "The bridal chamber of the haveli sat directly across from the top floor bedroom of the thakur's thikana. One day, the bride stood in her doorway, and the thakur stood outside his bedroom.",
  "**Their eyes met.**",
  "Finally, the thakur broke the silence: \"How long can we be patient? Come to my rang mahal.\"",
  "The bride trembled. \"How can I come? There are guards everywhere. I fear people will see me.\"",
  "The thakur thought quickly. \"I'll dig a tunnel underground and pretend it's for other work. Once complete, you can come and go as you please.\"",
  "**What does the bride feel in this moment?**"
]>>
<<set $currentChunk to 0>>

<div id="scene">
  <div id="game-container">
    <img id="background" src="images/tunnel.jpg">
  </div>
  <div id="dialogue-box" onclick="nextChunk()">
    <div class="narration-text" id="text-display">$textChunks[$currentChunk]</div>
    <span id="next-link" style="display:none;">
      [[She agrees immediately, overwhelmed by longing and loneliness|EagerAgreement]]
      [[She takes time to think deeply about the consequences|ThoughtfulHesitation]]
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
